    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Keith McLoughlin of Sheehy Meares Real Estate is delighted to bring to the market this attractive three-bedroom bungalow residence at Kilmurry, Castleplunkett, Co. Roscommon. Extending to approximately 900 sq. ft., the property stands on a generous site of approximately 0.519 acres and is comprised in Folio RN5441F.\n\nThe residence was extensively renovated and extended in 2020 and is presented in excellent condition throughout. The works included a complete rewiring and replumbing of the property, replacement windows and doors, upgraded insulation to both internal and external walls, together with an extension incorporating a new kitchen and bathroom. The property also benefits from a C3 BER energy rating.\n\nAccommodation includes an entrance hallway, three bedrooms, a bright and spacious kitchen/dining room with two windows providing excellent natural light, a comfortable sitting room with a solid fuel stove and French doors opening directly to the outside, together with a modern fully tiled bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property is surrounded by mature grass lawns with an attractive traditional stone wall forming the front boundary. There is also an open-fronted outbuilding providing useful storage, while the property benefits from double road frontage and a spacious site offering excellent outdoor space.\n\nThe property enjoys a pleasant rural setting while remaining within easy reach of a number of local towns and villages. Castleplunkett is approximately five minutes away, with both Tulsk and Castlerea less than ten minutes' drive. Roscommon Town is approximately 25 minutes away, while Ireland West Airport Knock is just over 30 minutes away.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a beautifully renovated, energy-efficient three-bedroom home on a generous site in a convenient countryside location."
      },
